      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 8867,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Truss in stresses: τEd = VEd/(bw·z) (8.18); spirals τRd,sy = ρw·fywd·cotθ (8.42); strut",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 8897,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "σcd = τEd·(cotθ + tanθ) ≤ ν·fcd (8.44), ν = 0.5 (8.2.3(6)). bw: least width between the",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6k",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 8927,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "compression chord (centroid of the concrete compression, §8.1) and the tension chord (d).",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 8957,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Each spiral crosses the shear plane twice: Asw = 2·Aw.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6m",
